<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Your OTP Code</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .otp-code { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; color: #007bff; letter-spacing: 5px; text-align: center; padding: 15px; background: #f8f9fa; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #777; margin-top: 30px; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Welcome to Thalorix</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
        <p>Use the following code to complete your {{action}}:</p>
        <div class="otp-code">{{otp}}</div>
        <p>This code will expire in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>.</p>
        <p>If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.</p>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; {{year}} Thalorix. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
